# libncursesw

`libncursesw` is the r10 owner of `libncursesw.so.6`. It is rebuilt from the
wide-character ncurses configuration selected by the reviewed K230 baseline.
The package intentionally contains only that runtime SONAME family; headers,
terminfo data, target programs, and other ncurses libraries remain outside its
payload until a separately audited package needs them.

`libreadline` is its first feed consumer. The release build graph creates this
provider before `libreadline`, which keeps target library ownership explicit.
